# Fleet manifest: the single source of truth for cell -> host -> phone scope. Install as /etc/cowabista/cells.manifest
# on EVERY transport host (identical copy). The guard refuses a cell whose env scope differs from this file, whose
# host differs, whose scope overlaps another cell's, or whose host already hosts another cell.
# Columns: <cell name = systemd instance> <hostname as `hostname` prints it> <scope: ids or inclusive ranges>
cell-1   host-c   1-4
cell-2   host-d   5-8
# A replacement for a dead cell keeps the SAME cell name and scope; only the hostname column changes if it runs
# on a new machine. Never give a replacement a different scope, never list a phone in two cells.
